  "items": [
    {
      "source": "This implementation creates a Spring <a href=\"../support/rowset/ResultSetWrappingSqlRowSet.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.support.rowset\"><code>ResultSetWrappingSqlRowSet</code></a>\ninstance that wraps a standard JDBC <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql.rowset/javax/sql/rowset/CachedRowSet.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql.rowset\"><code>CachedRowSet</code></a> instance.\nCan be overridden to use a different implementation.",
      "translation": "此实现会创建一个 Spring <a href=\"../support/rowset/ResultSetWrappingSqlRowSet.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.support.rowset\"><code>ResultSetWrappingSqlRowSet</code></a> 实例，该实例封装了一个标准的 JDBC <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql.rowset/javax/sql/rowset/CachedRowSet.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql.rowset\"><code>CachedRowSet</code></a> 实例。可以重写此实现以使用不同的实现方式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation uses JDBC's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql.rowset/javax/sql/rowset/RowSetFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql.rowset\"><code>RowSetFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认实现使用 JDBC 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql.rowset/javax/sql/rowset/RowSetFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql.rowset\"><code>RowSetFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation uses a standard JDBC CachedRowSet underneath.",
      "translation": "默认实现使用标准的 JDBC CachedRowSet 作为底层支持。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"../support/rowset/SqlRowSet.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support.rowset\"><code>SqlRowSet</code></a> that wraps the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/ResultSet.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>ResultSet</code></a>,\nrepresenting its data in a disconnected fashion.",
      "translation": "创建一个<a href=\"../support/rowset/SqlRowSet.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support.rowset\"><code>SqlRowSet</code></a>来包装给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java.sql/ResultSet.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>ResultSet</code></a>，以断开连接的方式表示其数据。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations must implement this method to process the entire ResultSet.",
      "translation": "实现必须实现此方法以处理整个 ResultSet。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"ResultSetExtractor.html#extractData(java.sql.ResultSet)\">extractData</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"ResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\">ResultSetExtractor</a>&lt;<a href=\"../support/rowset/SqlRowSet.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support.rowset\">SqlRowSet</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"ResultSetExtractor.html#extractData(java.sql.ResultSet)\">extractData</a></code>` 在接口 `<code><a href=\"ResultSetExtractor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\">ResultSetExtractor</a>&lt;<a href=\"../support/rowset/SqlRowSet.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support.rowset\">SqlRowSet</a>&gt;</code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/SQLException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\">SQLException</a></code> - if thrown by JDBC methods",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/SQLException.html\" title=\"java.sql 中的类或接口\">SQLException</a></code> - 如果由 JDBC 方法抛出",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>rs</code> - the original ResultSet (connected)",
      "translation": "<code>rs</code> - 原始 ResultSet（已连接）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the disconnected SqlRowSet",
      "translation": "断开的 SqlRowSet",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "a new CachedRowSet instance",
      "translation": "一个新的 CachedRowSet 实例",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql.rowset/javax/sql/rowset/CachedRowSet.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql.rowset\"><code>CachedRowSet</code></a> instance, to be populated by\nthe <code>createSqlRowSet</code> implementation.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql.rowset/javax/sql/rowset/CachedRowSet.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql.rowset\"><code>CachedRowSet</code></a>实例，由<code>createSqlRowSet</code>实现进行填充。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"ResultSetExtractor.html#extractData(java.sql.ResultSet)\">ResultSetExtractor</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"ResultSetExtractor.html#extractData(java.sql.ResultSet)\">ResultSetExtractor</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/SQLException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\">SQLException</a></code> - if an SQLException is encountered getting column\nvalues or navigating (that is, there's no need to catch SQLException)",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/SQLException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\">SQLException</a></code> - 如果在获取列值或导航时遇到 SQLException（即无需捕获 SQLException）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>rs</code> - the ResultSet to extract data from. Implementations should\nnot close this: it will be closed by the calling JdbcTemplate.",
      "translation": "<code>rs</code> - 从中提取数据的 ResultSet。实现不应关闭它：调用方 JdbcTemplate 将负责关闭它。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "an arbitrary result object, or <code>null</code> if none\n(the extractor will typically be stateful in the latter case).",
      "translation": "任意结果对象，或者如果没有则为<code>null</code>(在后一种情况下，提取器通常是有状态的)。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Juergen Hoeller",
      "translation": "Jürgen Hoeller",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
